OL,3,GNEWSACare home praised after
OL,4,Aoutstanding inspection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home has been praised for
OL,7,F"creating a warm and welcoming
OL,8,Fenvironment" after being rated
OL,9,Foutstanding in its first inspection.
OL,11,FCare Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,12,Finspectors gave Foxland Grange, on
OL,13,FWergs Road, Wolverhampton, it's top
OL,14,Frating for being effective, caring,
OL,15,Fresponsive and well-led, while safety
OL,16,Fwas rated as good.
OL,18,FThere are 89 people living at the home,
OL,19,Fwhich provides support to adults of all
OL,20,Fages living with dementia, nursing and
OL,21,Fresidential needs, physical
OL,22,Fdisabilities and sensory impairments.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
