OL,3,GNEWSACare home praised after
OL,4,Aoutstanding inspection
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Foxland Grange is an exceptional home
OL,7,Fbecause of the hard work and dedication
OL,8,Fof its leaders and staff," said Amanda
OL,9,FLyndon, CQC's deputy director of adult
OL,10,Fsocial care in the West Midlands.
